here to get my coffee food on (with soot obviously) and I cheated, ordering beignets. GUILTY AS CHARGED! Cafe Beignet is about 2 doors down from Pat O'Brien's. (FYI Pat O'Brien's has an entrance on St. Peter and on Bourbon Street). I walked in a little after 8:00 am and the player piano was already playing in tinny piano sound of music from days gone by. I was able to get a Cafe au Lait with soy milk. Last night I looked all over the French Quarter and could find coffee but no alternative milks. But alleluia, today, at Cafe Beignet I found it. The beignets here are bigger and yummier than anywhere else I found them. So this was a cheat.but sometimes when in Rome (or in this ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"99VA9y7rdlDzl_-Rd-WKKA","photo_id":"Eq9Bh_cc72gGYzHDs5vPtQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Eq9Bh_cc72gGYzHDs5vPtQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8843807578086853},{"business_id":"99VA9y7rdlDzl_-Rd-WKKA","photo_id":"COJcWbQ6GSnN6i5GoW3X8g","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/COJcWbQ6GSnN6i5GoW3X8g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8728784918785095},{"business_id":"99VA9y7rdlDzl_-Rd-WKKA","photo_id":"4yHwa9NjpEMWxJUfHW2jZg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/4yHwa9NjpEMWxJUfHW2jZg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8349996209144592},{"business_id":"99VA9y7rdlDzl_-Rd-WKKA","photo_id":"9f0Ns1-fEq93MmI4ejxDbA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/9f0Ns1-fEq93MmI4ejxDbA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8273263573646545},{"business_id":"99VA9y7rdlDzl_-Rd-WKKA","photo_id":"reTVcrsGa3zIMANhA1eodg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/reTVcrsGa3zIMANhA1eodg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8171602487564087}]},"notebook_case":null}
